WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:05.000
Narrator: You're Marshal 22 at the head of the Gate 4 exit stairs.

2
00:00:05.500 --> 00:00:13.000
Narrator: The final whistle has just gone, and fans are streaming down towards the exit gates beside the turnstiles.

3
00:00:13.500 --> 00:00:16.500
Narrator: Your supervisor is Sierra 2.

4
00:00:17.000 --> 00:00:19.500
Narrator: Over to you.
